---
import Layout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import {pathFor} from "../lib/paths.mjs";
import project from "../../public/project.json";
---
<Layout lang="de" root={true}>
<section class="locale-landing"><div class="narrow">
<div class="locale-landing__symbol">◇</div>
<p class="section-kicker">{project.name} {project.version} · {project.subtitle.de}</p>
<p class="locale-landing__premise">Die Menschheit hat über Jahrtausende versucht, Bücher zu schreiben, die für immer recht haben.</p>
<h1 class="locale-landing__question">Was wäre, wenn wir eines schreiben,<br/><em>das für immer lernen darf?</em></h1>
<div class="locale-landing__translation" lang="en">
<p>For thousands of years, humanity has tried to write books that would be right forever.</p>
<p class="locale-landing__translation-question">What if we wrote one that could keep learning forever?</p>
</div>
<p class="locale-landing__invite">Fragen stellen. Wissen prüfen. Verantwortlich handeln.<br/>Ask questions. Examine knowledge. Act responsibly.</p>
<div class="locale-landing__links">
<a href={pathFor("de")}>Deutsch <span>Originalfassung ↗</span></a>
<a href={pathFor("en")}>English <span>Translation draft ↗</span></a>
</div><p class="small-note">Weitere Sprachen können später folgen. / More languages may follow.</p>
</div></section>
</Layout>
